| 4b | RIGHT AFTER | the pūlama's honest edges. ''Built in this span'': `vault unlock` reads the house's own config (`pulamaStands` in `packages/lares-cli/src/house-config.ts`: `LAR_PULAMA_SOCKET` inside the vessel, else `LARES_PULAMA` in the surface env) and refuses `custody-probe-unread` on an unread custody probe, never falling to a prompt, and across a recomposition answers `pulama-waits` naming what the pūlama waits on (`packages/lares-cli/src/commands/vault.ts`); `containerRoot` reads the `lares` service by name (`LARES_SERVICE`), never the first `LAR_ROOT` it meets (`packages/lares-cli/src/mcp-resolve.ts`). The hand's lei acts stand at the pūlama's hand door beside light and admit (`packages/lararium-node/src/pulama-hand.ts`: `kui`, `restring` riding kui, `unstring`, sign-only, the vessel landing the record through `lares lei land`). ''Built since'' (2026-11-18): the tool door writes as the worn face, the store seam first (PR #266: a stale-base write keeps the face's actor, else refuses `stale-base-under-worn-face` or `worn-face-unwritable` by name), then the wiring (PR #275: a session's tool-door write lands under its face's own actor on every store the door reaches); the hand door's lei acts sign at the pūlama (PR #269), and both shims chain `lei terms`, the signing and `lei land` (PR #279). BUILT whole; nothing owed. Held by Lares-Awakens (backlog-awakens Wave 4b); rank 4l's routeless kūkulu now waits on rank 4c alone | The span's cold custody read named each edge, and every hand act at one door finishes the ruling of 2026-11-15. |

